  "description": "iTrainer Dog whistle & Clicker is a simple and easy to use app that bundles a dog whistle (with e-collar mode), squeaky toy sounds, a training clicker, and 100+ animal sound effects to assist with training your dog or pet!\n\nMain Features:\n• High frequency dog whistle. Easily adjust frequency, modulation, and speed\n• E-Collar mode that mimics tones used by popular E Collars\n• Dog training clicker with 5 unique, original clicker sounds\n• 20+ squeaker toy sounds\n• 100+ animal sounds to entertain and engage your dog or pet (dogs, cats, birds, farm animals, & more!)\n• Widgets (play the whistle, clicker and squeaker directly from your home screen, lock screen, and control center)\n• Record and save your own custom sounds\n• Reference guides for whistle training and positive-reinforcement obedience training\n• Apple Watch App\n• Works great on all iOS, iPadOS, and MacOS (with Apple silicon) devices\n• Dark mode support\n\nWhistle Training:\niTrainer leverages the power of high-frequency whistle training, a proven method for teaching recall and obedience. The sound can travel over long distances, making it ideal for outdoor training with working breeds like shepherds and hunting dogs.\n\nClicker Training:\nUsing positive reinforcement techniques, iTrainer’s clicker helps you clearly communicate with your pet. The consistent click sound paired with a reward encourages your dog to repeat desired behaviors, making training sessions more effective and enjoyable.\n\nSqueakers & Animal Sounds:\niTrainer offers 20+ squeaker toy sounds and over 100 animal sounds to capture your pet’s attention and keep them entertained. Whether you’re engaging your dog during playtime or providing mental stimulation, these sounds mimic real-world stimuli that intrigue pets like dogs, cats, birds, and farm animals. This makes it a perfect tool for keeping your pet focused and engaged during training sessions or simply offering them a fun distraction.\n\nJoin over 3 million pet owners who have already downloaded iTrainer! Improve your training techniques and bond with your dog by downloading iTrainer today—completely free!",
